        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1295753584881971200",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "“Only this past February did someone bother to quantify its bias.”\n\nOpen-source data is crucial for training models, but as AI engineers we need to look out for bias at the source. I chatted with @haydenfield about the solutions @Scale_AI is developing:\nhttps://t.co/PZmYde8Ord"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "615818451",
